The Ram twenty-five hundred,

279
00:11:21,191 --> 00:11:25,099
by contrast, averaged three thousand thirty-three dollars

280
00:11:25,099 --> 00:11:26,333
in the same study,

281
00:11:26,333 --> 00:11:29,761
and the Silverado thirty-five hundred two thousand

282
00:11:29,761 --> 00:11:31,543
seven hundred eighty-nine.

283
00:11:31,723 --> 00:11:34,420
So even within heavy-duty trucks,

284
00:11:34,420 --> 00:11:35,972
the range is large.

285
00:11:36,152 --> 00:11:38,485
That is exactly why you should never

286
00:11:38,485 --> 00:11:41,076
assume a truck's insurance cost from its

287
00:11:41,076 --> 00:11:41,400
size.

288
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:44,367
Now the hidden factors that change your

289
00:11:44,367 --> 00:11:44,769
price.

290
00:11:44,949 --> 00:11:46,307
The first is the trim.

291
00:11:46,487 --> 00:11:49,596
Pickup Truck Talk noted that larger wheels,

292
00:11:49,596 --> 00:11:52,849
towing equipment and other options can change

293
00:11:52,849 --> 00:11:55,235
a truck's value and repair costs,

294
00:11:55,235 --> 00:11:58,055
so different versions of the same model

295
00:11:58,055 --> 00:11:59,862
can get different quotes.

296
00:12:00,042 --> 00:12:02,440
A base work truck and a top-trim

297
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:05,137
luxury version of the same truck can

298
00:12:05,137 --> 00:12:07,310
have very different premiums.

299
00:12:07,659 --> 00:12:10,422
Color and body style usually matter less

300
00:12:10,422 --> 00:12:11,665
than people think.

301
00:12:11,845 --> 00:12:14,942
Insurers focus on the vehicle's value,

302
00:12:14,942 --> 00:12:18,365
repair costs, safety data and theft rates,

303
00:12:18,365 --> 00:12:20,239
and on you as a driver.

304
00:12:20,419 --> 00:12:22,547
A red truck does not cost more

305
00:12:22,547 --> 00:12:24,889
to insure just because it is red.

306
00:12:25,069 --> 00:12:27,218
But a crew cab top trim with

307
00:12:27,218 --> 00:12:30,213
expensive LED lights and big wheels can

308
00:12:30,213 --> 00:12:32,746
cost more than a regular cab work

309
00:12:32,746 --> 00:12:34,589
truck of the same model.

310
00:12:34,938 --> 00:12:36,912
The second is technology.

311
00:12:37,092 --> 00:12:39,890
Modern trucks are packed with cameras,

312
00:12:39,890 --> 00:12:42,688
radar and sensors for safety features.

313
00:12:42,868 --> 00:12:45,562
These features can help prevent crashes,

314
00:12:45,562 --> 00:12:46,908
which insurers like.

315
00:12:47,088 --> 00:12:49,170
But when a crash does happen,

316
00:12:49,170 --> 00:12:52,975
replacing and calibrating those systems is expensive.

317
00:12:53,155 --> 00:12:55,430
A cracked windshield on a truck with

318
00:12:55,430 --> 00:12:57,452
a camera behind it may need more

319
00:12:57,452 --> 00:12:58,716
than just new glass.

320
00:12:59,065 --> 00:13:01,167
The third is modifications.

321
00:13:01,347 --> 00:13:02,881
Lift kits, big wheels,

322
00:13:02,881 --> 00:13:06,437
aftermarket bumpers and performance parts can raise

323
00:13:06,437 --> 00:13:08,599
your premium, and if you do not

324
00:13:08,599 --> 00:13:10,621
tell your insurer about them,

325
00:13:10,621 --> 00:13:12,782
they may not be covered after a

326
00:13:12,782 --> 00:13:13,201
claim.

327
00:13:13,381 --> 00:13:16,171
Many truck owners discover this only after

328
00:13:16,171 --> 00:13:16,968
an accident.

329
00:13:17,148 --> 00:13:18,971
Always report modifications,

330
00:13:18,971 --> 00:13:21,118
and ask how each one affects your

331
00:13:21,118 --> 00:13:21,444
rate.

332
00:13:21,793 --> 00:13:23,279
The fourth is use.

333
00:13:23,459 --> 00:13:25,931
If you use your truck for business,

334
00:13:25,931 --> 00:13:28,473
hauling for pay or carrying tools to

335
00:13:28,473 --> 00:13:30,308
job sites as a contractor,

336
00:13:30,308 --> 00:13:32,991
your personal policy may not cover it.

337
00:13:33,171 --> 00:13:34,905
According to Insurify,

338
00:13:34,905 --> 00:13:38,844
business use can require commercial auto coverage,

339
00:13:38,844 --> 00:13:40,184
which costs more.

340
00:13:40,364 --> 00:13:43,108
Using a personal policy for business use

341
00:13:43,108 --> 00:13:44,892
can lead to denied claims.

342
00:13:45,241 --> 00:13:48,016
Towing is another detail worth checking.

343
00:13:48,196 --> 00:13:52,001
Your truck's insurance often covers liability when

344
00:13:52,001 --> 00:13:53,370
you tow a trailer,

345
00:13:53,370 --> 00:13:55,882
but damage to the trailer itself,

346
00:13:55,882 --> 00:13:57,403
or to what is on it,

347
00:13:57,403 --> 00:13:59,458
may need separate coverage.

348
00:13:59,638 --> 00:14:01,050
If you tow a boat,

349
00:14:01,050 --> 00:14:02,776
a camper or equipment,

350
00:14:02,776 --> 00:14:05,914
ask your insurer exactly what is covered

351
00:14:05,914 --> 00:14:07,718
before your first trip.

352
00:14:08,068 --> 00:14:10,042
And the fifth is financing.

353
00:14:10,222 --> 00:14:12,591
If you lease or finance a truck,

354
00:14:12,591 --> 00:14:15,700
the lender usually requires full coverage,

355
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:17,402
and often gap coverage,

356
00:14:17,402 --> 00:14:20,215
which pays the difference if the truck

357
00:14:20,215 --> 00:14:22,732
is totaled while you owe more than

358
00:14:22,732 --> 00:14:23,620
it is worth.

359
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:26,311
With long loans becoming common,

360
00:14:26,311 --> 00:14:28,351
gap coverage matters more.

361
00:14:28,531 --> 00:14:29,962
According to Edmunds,

362
00:14:29,962 --> 00:14:33,030
twenty-five point five percent of new vehicle

363
00:14:33,030 --> 00:14:35,483
loans in the third quarter of twenty

364
00:14:35,483 --> 00:14:38,551
twenty-six were eighty-four months or longer.

365
00:14:38,900 --> 00:14:41,679
Electric trucks deserve their own section,

366
00:14:41,679 --> 00:14:44,392
because they are often the most expensive

367
00:14:44,392 --> 00:14:45,054
to insure.

368
00:14:45,234 --> 00:14:47,171
The Hummer E V leads the most

369
00:14:47,171 --> 00:14:50,043
expensive list at four thousand one hundred

370
00:14:50,043 --> 00:14:52,848
eleven dollars, and the Lightning is close

371
00:14:52,848 --> 00:14:54,985
to the top at two thousand seven

372
00:14:54,985 --> 00:14:56,321
hundred forty-three.

373
00:14:56,501 --> 00:14:58,500
Battery packs are expensive,

374
00:14:58,500 --> 00:15:01,428
and even moderate damage near the battery

375
00:15:01,428 --> 00:15:03,712
can lead an insurer to total the

376
00:15:03,712 --> 00:15:04,141
truck.

377
00:15:04,490 --> 00:15:06,799
There is also the question of repair

378
00:15:06,799 --> 00:15:07,184
shops.

379
00:15:07,364 --> 00:15:10,021
Not every body shop is certified to

380
00:15:10,021 --> 00:15:14,119
work on electric truck batteries or aluminum-intensive

381
00:15:14,119 --> 00:15:16,397
bodies, like many Ford trucks.

382
00:15:16,577 --> 00:15:20,173
Fewer qualified shops can mean longer repairs

383
00:15:20,173 --> 00:15:21,532
and higher costs,

384
00:15:21,532 --> 00:15:24,889
and insurers include that in their prices.

385
00:15:25,069 --> 00:15:27,189
As more shops get certified,

386
00:15:27,189 --> 00:15:29,157
those costs may come down,

387
00:15:29,157 --> 00:15:32,337
but in twenty twenty-six they remain high.

388
00:15:32,687 --> 00:15:34,538
Here is the twist that links this

389
00:15:34,538 --> 00:15:35,323
to the market.

390
00:15:35,503 --> 00:15:37,962
The high cost of insuring and repairing

391
00:15:37,962 --> 00:15:40,295
electric trucks is one of the reasons

392
00:15:40,295 --> 00:15:41,935
buyers have been cautious.

393
00:15:42,115 --> 00:15:46,161
Ford ended production of the all-electric F-one-fifty

394
00:15:46,161 --> 00:15:49,290
Lightning in December twenty twenty-five,

395
00:15:49,290 --> 00:15:51,275
according to Fox Business.

396
00:15:51,455 --> 00:15:53,823
Insurance is part of the total cost

397
00:15:53,823 --> 00:15:57,137
of ownership, and electric pickups have struggled

398
00:15:57,137 --> 00:15:58,084
on that total.

399
00:15:58,434 --> 00:16:00,373
So how do you pay less?

400
00:16:00,553 --> 00:16:03,432
First, get insurance quotes before you choose

401
00:16:03,432 --> 00:16:04,071
the truck.

402
00:16:04,251 --> 00:16:07,514
Compare the exact trims you are considering.

403
00:16:07,694 --> 00:16:10,167
The difference between two trucks you like

404
00:16:10,167 --> 00:16:12,169
can be hundreds of dollars a year,

405
00:16:12,169 --> 00:16:13,347
and over five years,

406
00:16:13,347 --> 00:16:14,996
that can add up to more than

407
00:16:14,996 --> 00:16:17,469
the discount you negotiated at the dealer.

408
00:16:17,819 --> 00:16:20,761
Second, shop your policy every year or

409
00:16:20,761 --> 00:16:21,070
two.

410
00:16:21,250 --> 00:16:24,090
Rates change, and loyalty is not always

411
00:16:24,090 --> 00:16:24,745
rewarded.

412
00:16:24,925 --> 00:16:27,676
Third, consider a higher deductible if you

413
00:16:27,676 --> 00:16:29,313
have savings to cover it.

414
00:16:29,493 --> 00:16:30,910
That can lower your premium.

415
00:16:31,090 --> 00:16:33,359
Fourth, ask about discounts:

416
00:16:33,359 --> 00:16:35,708
bundling with home insurance,

417
00:16:35,708 --> 00:16:37,491
safe driving programs,

418
00:16:37,491 --> 00:16:38,787
and low mileage.

419
00:16:38,967 --> 00:16:41,532
Many truck owners in rural areas drive

420
00:16:41,532 --> 00:16:42,949
less than they think.

421
00:16:43,299 --> 00:16:46,122
Also think about telematics programs,

422
00:16:46,122 --> 00:16:48,715
where an app or device tracks your

423
00:16:48,715 --> 00:16:49,325
driving.

424
00:16:49,505 --> 00:16:52,192
Careful drivers can earn discounts,

425
00:16:52,192 --> 00:16:54,265
sometimes significant ones.

426
00:16:54,445 --> 00:16:57,020
But these programs record braking,

427
00:16:57,020 --> 00:16:58,687
speed and time of day,

428
00:16:58,687 --> 00:17:01,262
so drivers who often drive late at

429
00:17:01,262 --> 00:17:03,988
night or brake hard may not benefit.

430
00:17:04,168 --> 00:17:07,063
Read the program details before you sign

431
00:17:07,063 --> 00:17:07,280
up.

432
00:17:07,629 --> 00:17:09,080
And check your coverage,

433
00:17:09,080 --> 00:17:10,288
not just your price.

434
00:17:10,468 --> 00:17:13,160
The cheapest policy may have low liability

435
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:15,468
limits that leave you exposed if you

436
00:17:15,468 --> 00:17:17,839
cause a serious accident with a heavy

437
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:18,224
truck.

438
00:17:18,404 --> 00:17:19,523
Pickups are heavy,

439
00:17:19,523 --> 00:17:21,452
and a collision can cause a lot

440
00:17:21,452 --> 00:17:23,257
of damage to another vehicle.

441
00:17:23,437 --> 00:17:26,918
Many experts suggest higher liability limits for

442
00:17:26,918 --> 00:17:29,601
truck owners for exactly that reason.

443
00:17:29,951 --> 00:17:33,404
And fifth, choose the truck with insurance

444
00:17:33,404 --> 00:17:34,061
in mind.

445
00:17:34,241 --> 00:17:36,369
If two trucks fit your needs,

446
00:17:36,369 --> 00:17:39,010
the one with a lower insurance cost,

447
00:17:39,010 --> 00:17:41,798
lower repair costs and less theft risk

448
00:17:41,798 --> 00:17:44,586
can save you money every single month.

449
00:17:44,766 --> 00:17:47,515
A Maverick, a Ranger or a Ridgeline

450
00:17:47,515 --> 00:17:50,342
might cost hundreds less per year to

451
00:17:50,342 --> 00:17:53,798
insure than a performance or electric truck.

452
00:17:53,978 --> 00:17:55,902
That is real money over the life

453
00:17:55,902 --> 00:17:56,684
of the truck.

454
00:17:57,033 --> 00:17:59,248
Here is a simple example of how

455
00:17:59,248 --> 00:18:00,749
these choices add up.

456
00:18:00,929 --> 00:18:02,965
In the Compare dot com study,

457
00:18:02,965 --> 00:18:06,194
the Maverick averaged two thousand two hundred

458
00:18:06,194 --> 00:18:08,019
ninety-one dollars a year,

459
00:18:08,019 --> 00:18:11,389
while the Ram twenty-five hundred averaged three

460
00:18:11,389 --> 00:18:12,933
thousand thirty-three.

461
00:18:13,113 --> 00:18:15,328
That is a difference of about seven

462
00:18:15,328 --> 00:18:17,163
hundred forty dollars a year,

463
00:18:17,163 --> 00:18:19,757
or more than three thousand seven hundred

464
00:18:19,757 --> 00:18:21,275
dollars over five years.

465
00:18:21,455 --> 00:18:24,033
Insurance belongs in the price of the

466
00:18:24,033 --> 00:18:24,451
truck.

467
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:26,368
So what is the pattern?

468
00:18:26,548 --> 00:18:29,852
Truck insurance is not expensive because trucks

469
00:18:29,852 --> 00:18:30,414
are big.

470
00:18:30,594 --> 00:18:33,854
It is expensive when trucks are costly

471
00:18:33,854 --> 00:18:36,770
to repair, packed with technology,

472
00:18:36,770 --> 00:18:38,829
modified, used for work,

473
00:18:38,829 --> 00:18:41,403
or driven in high-risk places.

474
00:18:41,583 --> 00:18:46,124
Small, simple, popular trucks driven by experienced

475
00:18:46,124 --> 00:18:49,330
owners in quiet areas can be cheaper

476
00:18:49,330 --> 00:18:51,556
to insure than many cars.

477
00:18:51,905 --> 00:18:53,856
And here is the final twist.

478
00:18:54,036 --> 00:18:56,434
The biggest factor in your premium is

479
00:18:56,434 --> 00:18:58,378
not on any list in this video.

480
00:18:58,558 --> 00:18:59,192
It is you:

481
00:18:59,192 --> 00:19:01,095
your age, your driving record,

482
00:19:01,095 --> 00:19:02,808
your credit in many states,

483
00:19:02,808 --> 00:19:04,584
and where you park at night.

484
00:19:04,764 --> 00:19:07,202
The same truck can cost one driver

485
00:19:07,202 --> 00:19:09,640
half as much to insure as another.

486
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:11,493
That is why your own quote is

487
00:19:11,493 --> 00:19:13,570
the only number that really matters.

488
00:19:13,919 --> 00:19:15,789
And here is one more money tip.

489
00:19:15,969 --> 00:19:18,299
When you finish paying off a truck,

490
00:19:18,299 --> 00:19:21,228
review whether you still need full coverage.

491
00:19:21,408 --> 00:19:23,789
An older truck with a lower value

492
00:19:23,789 --> 00:19:26,603
may not be worth insuring for collision

493
00:19:26,603 --> 00:19:27,108
damage.

494
00:19:27,288 --> 00:19:29,803
Dropping coverage you no longer need can

495
00:19:29,803 --> 00:19:31,814
save hundreds of dollars a year,

496
00:19:31,814 --> 00:19:33,763
though you should only do it if

497
00:19:33,763 --> 00:19:35,963
you can afford to repair or replace

498
00:19:35,963 --> 00:19:37,157
the truck yourself.

499
00:19:37,506 --> 00:19:38,958
And keep a clean record.

500
00:19:39,138 --> 00:19:42,116
A single at-fault accident or a speeding

501
00:19:42,116 --> 00:19:45,169
ticket can raise your premium for several

502
00:19:45,169 --> 00:19:45,616
years.

503
00:19:45,796 --> 00:19:46,936
For truck owners,

504
00:19:46,936 --> 00:19:49,685
careful driving is not just about safety.

505
00:19:49,865 --> 00:19:52,036
It is one of the biggest long-term

506
00:19:52,036 --> 00:19:53,569
savings you can control.

507
00:19:53,918 --> 00:19:56,128
One more thing to know before you

508
00:19:56,128 --> 00:19:58,806
buy: insurance quotes are free and fast.

509
00:19:58,986 --> 00:20:01,361
Most insurers can give you a quote

510
00:20:01,361 --> 00:20:03,666
online in minutes if you have the

511
00:20:03,666 --> 00:20:07,019
vehicle identification number or the exact model

512
00:20:07,019 --> 00:20:07,647
and trim.

513
00:20:07,827 --> 00:20:09,653
There is no reason to wait until

514
00:20:09,653 --> 00:20:11,821
you are sitting in the finance office.

515
00:20:12,001 --> 00:20:14,013
A few quotes the night before you

516
00:20:14,013 --> 00:20:16,390
shop can change which truck you choose.

517
00:20:16,739 --> 00:20:17,986
And when you renew,

518
00:20:17,986 --> 00:20:19,363
look at what changed.

519
00:20:19,543 --> 00:20:21,070
If your truck is older,

520
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:22,529
its value has dropped,

521
00:20:22,529 --> 00:20:24,587
and you might not need the same

522
00:20:24,587 --> 00:20:25,847
collision coverage.

523
00:20:26,027 --> 00:20:26,865
If you moved,

524
00:20:26,865 --> 00:20:28,605
your rate may have changed.

525
00:20:28,785 --> 00:20:30,973
If your driving has improved,

526
00:20:30,973 --> 00:20:32,256
ask for a review.

527
00:20:32,436 --> 00:20:35,339
Insurance is not a set-and-forget bill.

528
00:20:35,519 --> 00:20:37,732
It is one of the easiest truck

529
00:20:37,732 --> 00:20:38,839
costs to lower.

530
00:20:39,189 --> 00:20:41,691
So here is your insurance checklist for

531
00:20:41,691 --> 00:20:42,974
twenty twenty-seven.

532
00:20:43,154 --> 00:20:45,879
First, get quotes on the exact trims

533
00:20:45,879 --> 00:20:47,393
you are considering,

534
00:20:47,393 --> 00:20:48,982
before you negotiate.

535
00:20:49,162 --> 00:20:53,172
Second, tell your insurer about modifications and

536
00:20:53,172 --> 00:20:54,236
business use.

537
00:20:54,416 --> 00:20:57,911
Third, consider gap coverage if you finance

538
00:20:57,911 --> 00:21:00,024
with a long loan or lease.

539
00:21:00,204 --> 00:21:03,478
Fourth, compare deductibles and discounts.

540
00:21:03,658 --> 00:21:06,299
And fifth, shop your policy again at

541
00:21:06,299 --> 00:21:07,326
every renewal.

542
