into the Twenty Twenty-Seven Truck Buyer's Guide,

545
00:21:15,551 --> 00:21:17,574
so you can see the real cost

546
00:21:17,574 --> 00:21:19,670
of a truck before you buy it.

547
00:21:19,850 --> 00:21:22,014
The link is in the description and

548
00:21:22,014 --> 00:21:23,414
in the pinned comment.

