about five hidden costs of owning a

551
00:21:28,498 --> 00:21:28,958
truck.

552
00:21:29,138 --> 00:21:30,830
And tell us in the comments:

553
00:21:30,830 --> 00:21:32,583
how much do you pay to insure

554
00:21:32,583 --> 00:21:33,248
your truck?

